  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A hack of Mighty Morphin Power Rangers III, which itself is a port of the SNES version of Mighty Morphin Power Rangers.  It includes all of the levels from Power Rangers III and adds several of its own from that game, with the final level being a boss rush. Also, each of the Power Rangers on the character select screen are duplicated."
    }
